 "notes": "Map sheet with a text layer (page 1); pages 2-4 are an unrelated FGDC symbol-style note bundled in the download and were not recorded. Symbol-description pairing and map-face well labels checked on a page image. Wells MINT-2 to MINT-12 labelled on the map face (MINT-7 also the legend sample; no MINT-1); no logs printed. Ages of QPftu, QPt-I and Qfp are shown only by the Correlation of Map Units and were not recorded. Dovesville beds and Oakland Crossroads member are named but not exposed, recorded only in the Duplin Formation description. NPbh plain elevation range recorded as a unit-top surface with no datum printed. North Carolina part not mapped. SUBSURFACE: none beyond the recorded values.",
